ts_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ehsaniara/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-27T02:29:36Z","updated_at":"2025-09-27T02:29:36Z","body":"  What appeared to be wrong:\r\n\r\n  - The job showed \"2025-09-25\" (yesterday) in the rnx job list output\r\n  - It looked like the job was \"stuck\" and should have already run\r\n\r\n  What was actually happening:\r\n\r\n  1. The job was correctly scheduled for 2025-12-31 23:59:59 (end of year)\r\n  2. The list command had a display bug - it was showing the job's creation time (when you created it yesterday) instead of its scheduled execution time\r\n  3. The rnx job status command showed the correct scheduled time, but rnx job list showed the wrong time","author_association":"OWNER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ehsaniara/joblet/issues/comments/3341035598/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ehsaniara/joblet/issues/comments/3441121880","html_url":"https://github.com/ehsaniara/joblet/issues/165#issuecomment-3441121880","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ehsaniara/joblet/issues/165","id":3441121880,"node_id":"IC_kwDOOwg9Ns7NG1pY","user":{"login":"ehsaniara","id":1542352,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1NDIzNTI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1542352?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ehsaniara","html_url":"https://github.com/ehsaniara","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ehsaniara/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ehsaniara/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ehsaniara/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ehsaniara/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ehsaniara/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ehsaniara/orgs",