ks for reporting this @jsturma.\n\n  This was a CI issue in v5.3.5. Please upgrade to v5.4.1 which includes correct ARM64 binaries:\n\n  ## Debian/Ubuntu ARM64\n  wget https://github.com/ehsaniara/joblet/releases/download/v5.4.1/joblet_5.4.1_arm64.deb\n  sudo dpkg -i joblet_5.4.1_arm64.deb\n\n  ## RHEL/Amazon Linux ARM64\n  sudo yum install -y https://github.com/ehsaniara/joblet/releases/download/v5.4.1/joblet-5.4.1-1.aarch64.rpm\n\n  I've also added architecture verification to the release workflow to prevent this in future releases.","author_association":"OWNER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ehsaniara/joblet/issues/comments/3609832708/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ehsaniara/joblet/issues/comments/4319946927","html_url":"https://github.com/ehsaniara/joblet/issues/257#issuecomment-4319946927","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ehsaniara/joblet/issues/257","id":4319946927,"node_id":"IC_kwDOOwg9Ns8AAAABAX0orw","user":{"login":"ehsaniara","id":1542352,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1NDIzNTI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1542352?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ehsaniara","html_url":"https://github.com/ehsaniara","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ehsaniara/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ehsaniara/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ehsaniara/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ehsaniara/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ehsaniara/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ehsaniara/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ehsaniara/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ehsaniara/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ehsaniara/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-25T15:25:55Z","updated_at":"2026-04-25T15:25:55Z","body":"Pass the already-loaded `cfg` from `runExecutePhase/runUploadPhase` down through `isolation.Setup` and `jobexec.Execute`.","author_association":"OWNER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ehsaniara/joblet/issues/comments/4319946927/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ehsaniara/joblet/issues/comments/4319962922","html_url":"https://github.com/ehsaniara/joblet/issues/257#issuecomment-4319962922","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ehsaniara/joblet/issues/257","id":4319962922,"node_id":"IC_kwDOOwg9Ns8AAAABAX1nKg","user":{"login":"ehsaniara","id":1542352,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1NDIzNTI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1542352?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ehsaniara","html_url":"https://github.com/ehsaniara","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ehsaniara/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ehsaniara/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ehsaniara/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ehsaniara/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ehsaniara/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ehsaniara/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ehsaniara/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ehsaniara/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ehsaniara/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-25T15:35:00Z","updated_at":"2026-04-25T15:35:00Z","body":"  - ` internal/modes/isolation/isolation.go`:29 , NewIsolator calls `cfg, _, _ :=  config.LoadConfig()`, swallowing all return values including errors.                                                         \n  - `internal/modes/jobexec/jobexec.go`:83 , Execute calls `LoadConfig` and checks err, `but LoadConfig` returns success when no config file is found (see `pkg/config/config.go`:511-541, `loadFromFile` returns\n  \"built-in defaults (no config file found)\" with nil error). So the error check does not catch the chroot case.                                                                                          \n  - `internal/modes/server.go`:447 and :452 , `runExecutePhase` already has a fully-loaded `cfg *config.Config` in scope, but calls `isolation.Setup(logger)` and `jobexec.Execute(logger)` with no cfg argument,\n  forcing each callee to reload from disk.                                                                                                                                                                \n  - Same problem in `runUploadPhase` at `internal/modes/server.go`:401.","author_association":"OWNER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ehsaniara/joblet/issues/comments/4319962922/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ehsaniara/joblet/issues/comments/4320002318","html_url":"https://github.com/ehsaniara/joblet/issues/260#issuecomment-4320002318","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ehsaniara/joblet/issues/260","id":4320002318,"node_id":"IC_kwDOOwg9Ns8AAAABAX4BDg","user":{"login":"ehsaniara","id":1542352,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1NDIzNTI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1542352?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ehsaniara","html_url":"https://github.com/ehsaniara","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ehsaniara/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ehsaniara/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ehsaniara/gists{/gist_id}","starr